# .dockerignore patterns are NOT recursive. Plain `node_modules` matched only
# the root one, so extensions/*/node_modules (19MB) still shipped to the daemon
# on every build. `**/` is what actually excludes them.
**/node_modules
**/build
**/dist
**/.cache
**/.vite
coverage
*.log

# Secrets must never enter an image layer. `COPY . .` was baking .env,
# .env.prod and the Shopify CLI's credential cache into the published image.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.shopify/

# Dev-only material
*.md
tests/
scripts/
seed_screenshots.sql
.git
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
